      "text": "In 24 hours, USBP agents arrested two undocumented non-citizens with sex crime convictions. Jose A. Salmeron-Blanco, a Salvadoran national convicted of 1st-degree sexual assault, was stopped at a McAllen, TX airport. Maximino Ortiz-Rodriguez, a Mexican national convicted of aggravated sexual battery of a child under 13, was apprehended in New Mexico. Both are in custody and will be processed. #bordersecurity",
