      "text": "USBP Apprehends Romanian National with INTERPOL Alert\n\nOn Monday, USBP agents in Niagara Falls, NY, apprehended a Romanian national illegally present in the U.S. Record checks revealed he has an active INTERPOL alert for forgery and prior convictions for obstructing justice, resisting arrest, and disorderly conduct. USBP remains committed to identifying criminals attempting to enter the country, with INTERPOL enabling law enforcement worldwide to detect and address these threats. #nationalsecurity",
